    <div id="mainContent">
      <h2 class="CH"><a name="1.06"></a>CHAPTER 1-06<br />CORPORATE LIMITS</h2>
            <p class="digCH">SECTIONS:</p>

            <p class="CiteTOC"><a href="../Flagstaff01/Flagstaff0106000.html#1.06.001.0001">1-06-001-0001</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;CORPORATE LIMITS DESIGNATED:</p>

      <h3 class="Cite" id="1.06.001.0001"><a name="1.06.001.0001">1-06-001-0001</a> CORPORATE LIMITS DESIGNATED:</h3>
            <p class="P0">The corporate limits of the City of Flagstaff shall be as shown and designated on the official plat on file in the office of the County Recorder of Coconino County, said plat also on file in the office of the City Clerk; and the boundaries of said corporate limits shall be as designated by that certain map on file in the office of the City Clerk and by reference made a part hereof. (Ord. 70/10; 8-24-1900; 1978 Code)</p>

    </div>
